<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 700 mln pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 700 mln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 700 million pounds for auction on February 3 and issue on February 4 when 182-day bills worth 762.550 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 9.999 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.40 Egyptian pounds)</p>
</text>
